Muse Plush (dsh-client-ui-skin-muse-plush)
=========================================

An unofficial skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI.

- The character "Muse" — its plush body, ears, brass-button eyes and the little
  mascot on the composer — is the author's own design, made for this skin. It is
  not derived from any third party's character or mascot, and claims no
  affiliation with any product of that name.
- Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek.
- No third-party artwork is bundled. Every visual is generated at runtime from
  original code: the fur texture is drawn with canvas, the mascot and its
  buttons are inline SVG, the fuzzy bubble edges are SVG displacement filters.
  No images, sprites, fonts or audio are shipped in this package.

Bundled code and artwork are original and licensed MIT (see LICENSE).
